{
  "summary": "This experiment tested transformer aggregation in an RNA-only multiprofile model, comparing it to the previously used avgpool aggregation (config_002). Validation accuracy of 0.5191 and F1 of 0.4797 are lower than config_002's 0.5907 accuracy, suggesting transformer aggregation may underperform in this setting. The role of aggregation method differences remains uncertain without direct comparison to other strategies, and other factors like fusion or encoder choices could influence outcomes."
}

